# Local backtracking reference — not for public consumption
original-agents/
original-file/
# research/b2b-commerce/ is a committed deliverable of the B2B Commerce research effort
# (docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-02-b2b-commerce-skills-design.md); everything else directly
# under research/ stays ignored (git can't re-include a path under a fully-ignored parent, so
# the parent is ignored one level at a time rather than recursively — same pattern as .claude/*
# below).
research/*
!research/b2b-commerce/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor
.vscode/settings.json
*.swp

# Per-machine assistant settings
.claude/settings.local.json

# Node (if tooling is ever added alongside)
node_modules/

# Local agent and skill data — installed third-party skills (`npx skills add`) and
# per-machine Claude data. skills-lock.json IS committed (pins sf-skills versions);
# a shared .claude/settings.json may be committed, settings.local.json is not.
# The installed sf-skills tree under .claude/skills/ stays ignored; only the named
# maintainer-only skills for THIS repo are committed (not under the shipped skills/
# tree, so the installer never offers them). Add a line per maintainer skill.
# `.agents/` is a local third-party install location (kept ignored so it can't be committed).
.agents/
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/regrounding-references/
!.claude/skills/updating-sf-skills/
